--- !u!114 &1544572714
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1544572706}
  m_Enabled: 0
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4ceef6ac683113a4cbfb949895698a59, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  cinematicScript: {fileID: 1544572712}
  uiScript: {fileID: 1544572716}
  FXscript: {fileID: 1544572713}
  isAbsolved: 0
  dialogueOver: 0
  confessedMurder: 0
  gloating: 0
  dialogue:
  - Are you ready to confess your sins?
  - Enter when you are ready...
  - 
  - How long has it been since your last confession?
  - That is quite recent, what are your transgressions
  - "\u2026.Our conversation here is private, but you must understand I may have
    to tell authorities in some circumstances"
  - Have you considered moving away from such an occupation?
  - There are places for people like you to go, to be rehabilitated, retrained, dont
    give up. Tell me your sins
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - These things can be forgiven, both in the eyes of the law and the lord
  - and how do you feel about this, do you feel guilt? You come again and again and
    keep repeating your sins
  - I can see your intentions are true...please make your penance
  - I absolve you
  - Give thanks to the Lord, for he is good.
  - 
  - 
  dialogue2:
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - And yet you are here.How long has it been since your last confession
  - Its never a bad time to start, you must have much to speak about
  - 
  - 
  - I see, well I can offer you little advice otherwise. State your sins in detail
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - "\u2026how many\u2026killed?"
  - You say you feel guilt, but you want to get back to it, you must mean it when
    you confess, its not just a facade.
  - I dont believe you truly mean it
  - ' I cannot absolve you, I''m sorry. May god be more merciful than me'
  - 
  - 
  - 
  dialogue3:
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - Please leave...
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 'You clearly Fell no Shame at all!! In fact you relish in it! '
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  d: 0
  dLimit: 17
  dialogueObject: {fileID: 0}
  goodDialogue:
  - Yes
  - Bless me Father for I have sinned
  - 3 weeks
  - I live a life of crime, guilt quickly builds up
  - 'I understand father '
  - Its all ive ever known, I have no other skills and a huge rap sheet. I dont know
    where to go
  - "I confess that I have: 1:Stolen\u2026"
  - (and) nothing else
  - (and) nothing else
  - (and) nothing else
  - I hope so father, all the stress eats away at me, I need to abandon this life
  - I see tortured visions every time, but Its unavoidable, I dont set out to kill,
    I just dont want to be locked up
  - ' "O God, be merciful to me, a sinner."'
  - Thank you
  - His mercy endures for ever.
  - 
  goodDialogue2:
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - "More than I can count\u2026"
  - 
  - 
  - I understand, I just needed to get it off my chest
  - 
  - 
  gd: 0
  goodText: {fileID: 0}
  badDialogue:
  - No
  - "I don\u2019t believe in confession"
  - This is my first time
  - I live a life of crime, I could write you a novel.
  - Fuck no, I cant trust you, im leaving
  - I'm good at it, I make a lot of money from it, why would I stop
  - 
  - Trespassed
  - Decieved
  - Killed
  - I am not going to the law! I just need to absolve my guilt so I can get back
    to it
  - I just need to clear my head every now and then, so I can keep going, thats all
  - 
  - 
  - ...
  - 
  badDialogue2:
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - well, I dont mean to brag but its probably close to 50
  - 
  - 
  - I did all of this for nothing?
  - Great Guilt Free!
  - 
  bd: 0
  badText: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueHolder: {fileID: 0}
  waitForSpeech: 0
